      "content": "idk... the \"rebuilding\" part just feels impossible. like there's nothing left to rebuild. it's not just that they're gone, it's like the version of me that they knew is just dead. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person, just a ghost waiting for something to happen. it's so quiet. i'm just so tired of pretending i'm still here.",
